Thank you @hubertlu-tw for reproducing this on XGMI and for the approval!

I only have PCIe-connected Radeon GPUs (gfx1201), so I can't validate the XGMI follow-up myself. I think it would fit best alongside #34543 (cc @vvagaytsev), and I'm happy to test it on the PCIe side.

@yizhang2077 @merrymercy @ch-wan, when you have a moment, could one of you take a look so this can be merged? Thank you!

